  "numbering_rule": "Preserve historical J01-J25; append J26 on H2. H2a and H2b are the two SUMO segments of the same shorter arc H2. Append P20 for the straight J05-J15 park footway; all historical road and junction labels stay unchanged. Append P21 and J27/J28; P14a/P14b and P20a/P20b retain the original logical P14/P20 road numbers after splitting. Append P22/P23 and J29/J30/J31; P15a/P15b and P17a/P17b retain the original logical P15/P17 numbers after splitting. Both added roads terminate at J31. Append P24 from J31 to J32 on P13, at equal angles to P22/P23. P13a/P13b retain the original logical P13 number after splitting. Append P25 from J29 to new J33 at the J28-J15 midpoint, and P26 from J21 to new J34 at one third of the full J18-J30 polyline length from J18. Append P20c and P17c while preserving the original physical-road numbers and the P17 bend. Append P27a/P27b/P27c for the three-segment J34-J35-J36-J30 northeast trapezoid branch. Preserve the existing P17b bend. Relative to the J34-J30 chord, the northeast short base is half the southwest long base, the legs are equal, and J34-J35 is parallel and codirectional with P26. J35/J36 are real pedestrian corner junctions. Append P28 from J33 northeast to free endpoint J37, perpendicular to J15-J28 and half of the complete junction-to-junction J15-J13/P16 centerline length. J33 is rebuilt as a four-arm pedestrian junction; J37 is a one-arm dead end.",
